### Page 4 of 8

```text
Page 38, addition of the following language, “Hynds Building and “The Hole”. Streamline the development process and explore a public-
private partnership within legal constraints to restore the historic 1916 Hynds Building and redevelop both the building and the adjacent
vacant lot known as “The Hole” for economic development and community revitalization. Support urban renewal efforts, including the
use of TIF funding, to aid in the redevelopment of these properties.
```

